{"title":"Tome Toolsmithing Titanium","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Ogre Elder, Thak Footman, Ogre Shaman, Ogre Charger, Kragg The Unmoved</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-unmoved\" title=\"Kragg The Unmoved - dropped it in 1 of 21 looted corpses (1/21)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/0dd1fe765b90d83e2fba.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Kragg The Unmoved</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/21<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-elder\" title=\"Ogre Elder - dropped it in 3 of 257 looted corpses (1/86)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/6b8e9887508499fc36f7.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Elder</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/86<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"thak-footman\" title=\"Thak Footman - dropped it in 3 of 1,183 looted corpses (1/394)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7bd0bd081dd39324d454.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thak Footman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/394<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-charger\" title=\"Ogre Charger - dropped it in 1 of 542 looted corpses (1/542)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/253503604ab2f59ece68.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Charger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/542<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+1 more\">+1 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-shaman\" title=\"Ogre Shaman - dropped it in 1 of 636 looted corpses (